{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"单射"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"单射"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>单射就是 $(-1)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"截断性","text":"截断"}},{"Plain":"映射.</p>\n<p>在"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":"的范畴 "},{"Local":{"url":"Ani","text":"$\\mathsf{Ani}$"}},{"Plain":" 中, 映射 $f\\colon Y\\to X$ 是单射, 当且仅当它是 $X$ 的若干连通分支的含入.</p>\n"}]}}